# Accidental sync destinations: running `xs <src> xs` (or similar) from a crate
# directory writes generated test corpora into a literal `xs/` directory.
# Nothing in this repo is legitimately named `xs/`; the binary is target/*/xs.
xs/

# Raw benchmark run artifacts. benches/results/tuning holds ~22.6k per-run
# JSON files (~268 KB each, ~715 MB) that are regenerable bench output and
# dominated the tracked-file count. Keep the human-readable summaries
# (DECISION.md / README.md / matrix.md / report-*.md), drop the raw data.
benches/results/tuning/**
!benches/results/tuning/**/
!benches/results/tuning/**/*.md

